>" placeholder="<?php echo e(t('Example: Strategic alignment'));?>"></label><label class="block text-sm"><span class="font-medium"><?php echo e(t('What should the evaluator consider?'));?></span><textarea class="fd-input w-full mt-1" rows="2" name="description"><?php echo e($editingCriterion['description']??'');?></textarea></label><label class="block text-sm"><span class="font-medium"><?php echo e(t('Criterion weight'));?></span><input type="number" min="0" step="0.1" class="fd-input w-full mt-1" name="weight" value="<?php echo e((string)($editingCriterion['weight']??1));?>"><span class="block text-xs text-theme-muted mt-1"><?php echo e(t('Higher weights make this criterion more influential in the final score.'));?></span></label><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><label class="text-sm flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="is_required" value="1" <?php echo !$editingCriterion||!empty($editingCriterion['is_required'])?'checked':'';?>><?php echo e(t('Required score'));?></label><label class="text-sm flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="is_active" value="1" <?php echo !$editingCriterion||!empty($editingCriterion['is_active'])?'checked':'';?>><?php echo e(t('Active'));?></label></div><button class="fd-button fd-button--primary w-full"><?php echo e($editingCriterion?t('Save changes'):t('Add criterion'));?></button></form><div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-theme-light"><?php foreach($criteria as $criterion):?><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2"><span><strong class="block text-sm"><?php echo e($criterion['name']);?></strong><span class="text-xs text-theme-muted"><?php echo e($criterion['committee_name']?:t('All committees'));?> · <?php echo e($criterion['type_name']?:t('All types'));?> · <?php echo e(t('weight {weight}',['weight'=>$criterion['weight']]));?></span></span><span class="flex"><a class="p-2 text-theme-muted hover:text-indigo-600" href="<?php echo e($baseTabUrl('committee',['edit_criterion'=>(int)$criterion['id']]));?>"><?php echo get_icon('edit','w-4 h-4');?></a><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('<?php echo e(t('Delete this criterion?'));?>')"><?php echo csrf_field();?><input type="hidden" name="initiative_admin_action" value="delete_criterion"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?php echo (int)$criterion['id'];?>"><button class="p-2 text-theme-muted hover:text-red-600"><?php echo get_icon('trash','w-4 h-4');?></button></form></span></div><?php endforeach;?></div></div>
 </div>

 <?php else:?>
 <div class="fd-card p-5"><div class="mb-5"><h2 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary"><?php echo e(t('Agent permissions'));?></h2><p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1"><?php echo e(t('Only administrators can change these permissions. Administrators are not listed because they already have full initiative access.'));?></p></div><?php if(!$agents):?><p class="text-sm text-theme-muted"><?php echo e(t('No active agents found.'));?></p><?php else:?><form method="get" class="flex gap-2 mb-5"><input type="hidden" name="page" value="admin"><input type="hidden" name="section" value="initiatives"><input type="hidden" name="tab" value="permissions"><select class="fd-select flex-1" name="permission_user_id" onchange="this.form.submit()"><?php foreach($agents as $agent):?><option value="<?php echo (int)$agent['id'];?>" <?php echo $permissionUserId===(int)$agent['id']?'selected':'';?>><?php echo e(trim($agent['first_name'].' '.$agent['last_name']).' · '.$agent['email']);?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><noscript><button class="fd-button fd-button--secondary"><?php echo e(t('Load'));?></button></noscript></form><form method="post"><?php echo csrf_field();?><input type="hidden" name="initiative_admin_action" value="permissions"><input type="hidden" name="user_id" value="<?php echo $permissionUserId;?>"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><?php foreach(initiative_capabilities() as $capability):$meta=$capabilityLabels[$capability]??[$capability,''];?><label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg border border-theme-light cursor-pointer hover:bg-theme-secondary"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-1" name="capabilities[]" value="<?php echo e($capability);?>" <?php echo !empty($configuredPermissions[$capability])?'checked':'';?>><span><strong class="block text-sm text-theme-primary"><?php echo e($meta[0]);?></strong><span class="block text-xs text-theme-muted mt-0.5"><?php echo e($meta[1]);?></span></span></label><?php endforeach;?></div><div class="flex justify-end mt-4"><button class="fd-button fd-button--primary"><?php echo e(t('Save permissions'));?></button></div></form><?php endif;?></div>
 <?php endif;?>
</section>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sortablejs@1.15.0/Sortable.min.js"></script>
<script>
(function () {
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-icon-picker] input[name="icon"]').forEach(function (radio) {
    radio.addEventListener('change', function () {
      var details = radio.closest('[data-icon-picker]');
      var label = details && details.querySelector('[data-icon-picker-label]');
      var visual = radio.nextElementSibling;
      if (label && visual) label.innerHTML = visual.querySelector('svg').outerHTML + '<span>' + radio.dataset.iconLabel + '</span>';
      if (details) details.removeAttribute('open');
    });
  });

  var kind = document.getElementById('initiative-unit-kind');
  var parent = document.getElementById('initiative-parent-id');
  var parentHelp = document.getElementById('initiative-parent-help');
  function syncParents() {
    if (!kind || !parent) return;
    var allowed = kind.value === 'area' ? ['area'] : ['area', 'unit'];
    Array.prototype.forEach.call(parent.options, function (option, index) {
      if (!index) return;
      option.hidden = allowed.indexOf(option.dataset.kind) === -1;
      option.disabled = option.hidden;
      if (option.selected && option.hidden) parent.value = '';
    });
    if (parentHelp) parentHelp.textContent = kind.value === 'area'
      ? <?php echo json_encode(t('An area may be top-level or belong to another area.')); ?>
      : <?php echo json_encode(t('Units and cost centers may belong to an area or unit.')); ?>;
  }
  if (kind) { kind.addEventListener('change', syncParents); syncParents(); }

  var orgList = document.getElementById('initiative-org-sort');
  if (orgList && window.Sortable) {
    new Sortable(orgList, { animation: 150, handle: '.initiative-org-handle', onEnd: function () {
      var order = Array.prototype.map.call(orgList.querySelectorAll('[data-org-id]'), function (item) { return Number(item.dataset.orgId); });
      var body = new URLSearchParams();
      body.set('csrf_token', window.csrfToken || '');
      body.set('initiative_admin_action', 'reorder_org_units');
      body.set('order', JSON.stringify(order));
      fetch(<?php echo json_encode($baseTabUrl('structure')); ?>, { method: 'POST', headers: {'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'}, body: body.toString() });
    }});
  }

  var chips = document.getElementById('checkpoint-chips');
  var addCheckpoint = document.getElementById('add-checkpoint');
  var checkpointInput = document.getElementById('checkpoint-day-input');
  function bindCheckpointRemove(scope) {
    scope.querySelectorAll('[data-remove-checkpoint]').forEach(function (button) {
      button.onclick = function () { button.closest('span').remove(); };
    });
  }
  if (chips) bindCheckpointRemove(chips);
  if (addCheckpoint && checkpointInput && chips) addCheckpoint.onclick = function () {
    var day = Math.max(1, parseInt(checkpointInput.value || '0', 10));
    if (!day || chips.querySelector('input[value="' + day + '"]')) return;
    var chip = document.createElement('span');
    chip.className = 'inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-theme-secondary text-sm';
    chip.innerHTML = '<input type="hidden" name="measurement_checkpoints[]" value="' + day + '"><span>' + day + ' ' + <?php echo json_encode(t('days')); ?> + '</span><button type="button" class="text-theme-muted hover:text-red-600" data-remove-checkpoint>&times;</button>';
    chips.appendChild(chip); bindCheckpointRemove(chip); checkpointInput.value = ''; checkpointInput.focus();
  };
})();
</script>
<?php require_once BASE_PATH . '/includes/footer.php'; ?>
